       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TSTENVCH.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TEST-KEY-NAME.
          05 FILLER PIC X(14) VALUE "OPENAI_API_KEY".
          05 FILLER PIC X VALUE LOW-VALUE.
       01 TEST-SENTINEL-NAME.
          05 FILLER PIC X(16) VALUE "COBOLLM_SENTINEL".
          05 FILLER PIC X VALUE LOW-VALUE.
       01 TEST-KEY-PTR            USAGE POINTER.
       01 TEST-SENTINEL-PTR       USAGE POINTER.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 TEST-SENTINEL           PIC X(4).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           SET TEST-KEY-PTR TEST-SENTINEL-PTR TO NULL
           CALL "TSTGETENV" USING BY REFERENCE TEST-KEY-NAME
               TEST-KEY-PTR
           CALL "TSTGETENV" USING BY REFERENCE TEST-SENTINEL-NAME
               TEST-SENTINEL-PTR
           IF TEST-SENTINEL-PTR NOT = NULL
               SET ADDRESS OF TEST-SENTINEL TO TEST-SENTINEL-PTR
           END-IF
           IF TEST-KEY-PTR = NULL AND
              TEST-SENTINEL-PTR NOT = NULL AND
              TEST-SENTINEL = "keep"
               DISPLAY "ENV-OK" WITH NO ADVANCING
               MOVE ZERO TO RETURN-CODE
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "ENV-BAD" WITH NO ADVANCING
               MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
           END-IF
           SET ADDRESS OF TEST-SENTINEL TO NULL
           GOBACK.

       END PROGRAM TSTENVCH.
